<p>Intended as Mandan's second community center, the World War Memorial Building was constructed at a cost of $125,000 ($3.1 million in 2025$). At the dedication IN 1934, ND Supreme Court Justice A. M. Christianson declared the building "a living memorial, a daily tribute to our men who our men who gave their lives in the great World War."</p>

